      "message": "test(thread): judge the external M8 golden in posted_gates\n\nThe merged chain's guard (#862: every posted golden is judged or named\nin UNJUDGED) now sees thread_mill_external_m8_multi_form.nc: the\nposted_gates thread module regenerates it on the stud fixture (stock\ncleared round the boss by the roughing ahead), proves it byte-identical\nto its CL golden and runs the generator's blocking laws and the post's\nverification gate. The stud world builders move from thread_boss.rs to\nthread_support::boss so both suites share them.\n\nRefs #985\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
